From: Kiran Gopinathan <kiran@basis.ai>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 01:00:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] feat: Paralean hook 4, simp used-lemma record

With `simpUsed`, `evalSimp` and `evalSimpAll` push the declarations in
`stats.usedTheorems` as a `SimpUsedInfo` custom info leaf. `rfl` simp lemmas do
not appear in proof terms, so this is the only record of them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
